WEBVTT

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.790
Was bringing Soran and Houhou 
here the right thing to do?

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.440
You worry too much.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.590
Let them do what they want tonight.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:22.240
Soran's hidden the fact that 
he's an outsider until now.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:27.950
It's been a while since we met him, 
but I've never seen him so happy.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.460
Have some more.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.610
What's the big idea?!

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.840
He's probably been suppressing 
himself for a while.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.660
It's fine for him to cut 
loose every now and then.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.670
Hey, guys!

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.680
You wanna see my **** that badly?

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.780
Go for it, Chou Soran!

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:44.940
Show us!

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.710
Go!

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:46.760
You can do it!

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.400
Go!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.560
Here I go.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:53.280
This is Chou Soran!

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.070
I see it.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.070
He's marked with mystical symbols.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.330
Too bad this mysterious light is 
making everything blurry, though!

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:04.160
Mysterious light?

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.450
That doesn't matter.

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.470
Open the eyes of your heart, and you'll see!

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.070
H-How wonderful!

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:19.340
It's so different from those modern 
and over-exaggerated designs!

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:25.270
It retains a certain classic simplicity while 
having a both unique and mystical beauty!

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.130
Wow! It's so cool!

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:31.900
What do you think?

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.970
Chou Soran's quite the man, isn't he?

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:35.380
Look! Look!

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:40.110
<i>My master was wrong.</i>

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:43.570
<i>We should never have let 
this idiot enter Ryuukosan.</i>

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.450
Unbelievable.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:56.540
She rejected me just for 
being a little short...

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:59.220
Isn't she mean?

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.560
Fuu Houhou.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.340
You must be bored by yourself.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:05.940
Drink with us.

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:08.730
Okay.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.500
The months that pass within my dreams

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:39.430
I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:45.680
If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:51.150
In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:55.020
Shangri-la is nowhere to be found

00:02:55.230 --> 00:03:00.820
No one knows the love of the spring wind

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:10.040
The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:18.010
Trading places, they bloom then wilt

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:21.840
In January, I pick a flower with no petals

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:29.180
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.690
In March, the peach blossoms bloom

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:40.650
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:44.700
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:48.790
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:58.750
<b>8: Nouyou Insou</b>

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:18.640
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:04.040
Nothing happened last night.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.530
Right?

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:10.260
I just had a bit to drink while looking 
at the moon, then I went to sleep.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.990
Right, guys?

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:18.020
Yeah, and we saw your little 
Soran in the moonlight.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.650
Then your little Soran 
turned into a phoenix.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:26.210
And finally, your phoenix turned into 
a woodpecker and pecked some trees.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:28.230
Enough! I don't want to hear anymore!

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:31.240
Everyone makes mistakes, son.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:36.280
Although I wasn't expecting to see a phoenix 
after coming all the way out to Ryuukosan.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.980
Everyone will forget in a couple of days.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.040
Probably.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:47.750
Chou Soran, you're a legend among outsiders!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.860
You didn't take pictures, did you?

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:57.520
Don't worry. I didn't take any photos.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.090
I took a video.

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.190
What should we do, Hana-chan?

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:05.630
Hey, wait! Erase the data!

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:06.980
I can't look Soran in the face anymore.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.490
No way.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:08.750
Then I'll break it!

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.230
What are you looking at?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.010
Give me your phone!

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.410
I'm joking. I didn't film anything.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.400
Don't lie to me!

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.370
Leave her be.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.910
Hana-chan copied all the 
symbols in his seal.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:21.180
She's completely obsessed 
with them right now.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:29.300
Hey! Get down here, damn it!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.250
You climb up here.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:33.130
Aren't you a woodpecker?

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:36.680
You asshole! You'll pay once 
you come down from there!

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.120
Got that? Don't forget it!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.080
Hey, listen to me!

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:42.900
Isn't that...

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:48.290
Hey, Chou Soran. You'd better 
hurry back to the arena.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:51.060
Your next opponent is there.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.320
I can't see...

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:56.000
My opponent is...

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.040
Tou Bunryuu, huh?

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:05.170
<i>Even if I win this round, my next 
opponent will be Shokatsu Sei or Ouya-san.</i>

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:12.070
The Elders said they drew lots, 
but you sure are unlucky.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:15.250
The rest of your matches won't be easy.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:20.060
Damn. And it's too late to ask 
Hou-nee to take them out...

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.450
What should I do?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.240
Hey, Zouryuu.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:33.110
I've got a good deal for you.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:34.840
Why don't you come with me?

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:39.900
All match participants, please 
enter the arena at once.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.860
Chou Soran versus Tou Bunryuu.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.980
Fuu Houhou versus Shoushou.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.600
Oh, that's me.

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:48.160
Fuu Houhou.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:52.140
I don't like fighting.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.600
Don't get full of yourself 
just because you beat me.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:07:01.870
Shoushou's shinki is far 
stronger than my nagareniji.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.850
You'd best be careful.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.820
Approach carelessly, and 
he'll defeat you easily.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:11.250
If you can't use projectiles, 
you might as well admit defeat.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.060
Hey!

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:14.360
Ow! What was that for?

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:16.360
Whose side are you on?

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.460
Why are you giving away my strategies?

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:20.880
I wasn't trying to.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:25.490
Unbelievable. Once this 
match is over, you're next.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.530
<i>Fuu Houhou...</i>

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.470
<i>Poor girl.</i>

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:36.540
<i>She just had to be matched against 
an opponent who attacks souls.</i>

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:41.010
<i>Her soul is already scarred enough.</i>

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.770
Sei-nii, hurry up.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.000
We'll have a better view from here.

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:51.560
But why are we watching this match?

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:54.150
I'm more interested in Chou Soran's.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.950
Do you know Shoushou and Fuu Houhou?

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:01.650
I don't know either of them.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.500
Then why?

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.610
I just happened to see them.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.110
So I followed them.

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:12.290
No way! Three of the Elders?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.850
Why would they bother watching this match?

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:16.840
That's why I'm curious.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:20.840
They came to watch this 
match, not Chou Soran's.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:24.290
What attracts them to this one?

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:27.200
Chou Soran! Chou Soran!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.260
Please enter the arena immediately!

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:33.690
Chou Soran's up to something again.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.370
Nah, he probably ran this time.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.940
His opponent is Tou Bunryuu, after all.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:41.050
I'm counting on you, Tou Bunryuu!

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:43.790
Teach that shameless cheater a lesson!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.680
I hope you lose, Chou Soran!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.470
You idiot!

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:49.010
Be quiet.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.720
Watch this match closely.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:56.300
Chou Soran! Please enter 
the arena immediately!

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.940
<i>He's finally here.</i>

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:09.460
<i>Chou Soran...</i>

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:13.100
<i>Your tricks won't work against Tou Bunryuu.</i>

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:18.250
The match between Chou Soran and 
Tou Bunryuu will now begin!

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:24.370
Chou Soran, I have another match after this.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.370
Let's get this over with.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:29.270
Nice to meet you, Bunryuu-san.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.370
In that case, I won't hold back!

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.140
<i>How is he so fast?</i>

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:40.810
<i>I avoided a critical blow, 
but he got my left hand.</i>

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.720
I had no idea you were hiding such strength.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.000
Not bad.

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:05.950
But playtime is over.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.900
I'll take you out with my poisonous mist.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.920
Now, come!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.840
<i>The next time you touch me, you'll 
be afflicted with a powerful poison.</i>

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.730
<i>You can't win.</i>

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.730
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.780
<i>If you surround yourself with poisonous mist,</i>

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.480
<i>I just need to beat you without touching you.</i>

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:39.390
Come on, Ryuu-chan. Over here.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:41.480
What did you want to discuss?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:43.450
The match will begin shortly!

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:45.650
I want information on Tou Bunryuu.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.780
Chou Soran, please enter the arena!

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:48.910
We're good enough friends 
for you to tell me, right?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.570
You think I'd tell you that for free?

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.790
Shut up and tell me.

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.670
You got to see my seal for free.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:03.090
Or do you want me to use my Raihou to 
put you in bandages this time, huh?

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.810
Okay, I'll tell you!

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.380
Tou Bunryuu is a user of Toumon.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:13.140
Be careful of the poisonous 
mist those guys use.

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:18.750
If you touch him while he's surrounded 
by it, you'll be poisoned.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:22.030
And once you're poisoned, you'll have 
practically no chance of winning.

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:25.020
So don't attack him carelessly.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:30.070
He uses... Toumon?

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:31.770
That's right.

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:37.340
In any case, once the match begins, it's 
important to calmly observe your opponent.

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:41.860
Activating his poisonous 
mist consumes a lot of ki.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.930
It may be effective to engage in a 
battle of endurance from a distance.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:46.980
Toumon...

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.160
They killed Grandpa...

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:14.460
<i>I don't have anything against this guy, 
but I can't hold back against a Toumon user.</i>

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.200
<i>Grandpa...</i>

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:35.370
Tenshi, it seems Soran is fighting 
against a Toumon warrior.

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:36.900
Do you not need to watch his match?

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:40.940
The outcome of the match will 
be determined by his luck.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:43.850
My going won't change anything.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.010
Anyway, this match is more 
important right now.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.820
Shinchuu, you must be able to tell.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:59.870
What school does the girl who's fighting 
belong to, and who is her master?

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:04.420
I have no idea.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:07.260
She moves in a strange way.

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:10.770
Her movements are full of openings.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:13.760
Normally she'd have been defeated by now.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:20.620
But she always manages to 
avoid fatal blows by a hair.

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:26.760
You can't see it because you 
only have eyes for Soran.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.860
What do you mean?

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:33.630
You didn't notice when we 
met that girl yesterday?

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.570
It's her eyes.

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:37.660
Her eyes?

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:42.510
Sounds like you don't understand 
what Rikukin's talking about.

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:45.230
Look into my eyes.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.480
Where are your eyes?

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.350
You have so many wrinkles, 
I can't find them.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.430
Do you want me to push you off?

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:57.850
I'm joking. I know what 
you're trying to say.

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:02.640
Ordinary people have light in their eyes.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:10.400
But after a hundred years of training, 
the light has gone out of yours.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:17.740
However, those tranquil and unaffected 
eyes are proof of your divine power.

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:20.460
But Tenshi...

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:25.670
It takes nearly a hundred 
years to reach your level.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:31.860
Are you saying she's already achieved that?

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:35.680
That can't be. It's impossible.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:41.900
You're right. It's possible she 
hasn't reached that level.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:47.320
Her movements are all intuitive 
reactions based on instinct.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:52.590
She's probably innately 
well-suited to training.

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:56.770
Being young doesn't prevent you 
from achieving divine power.

00:14:57.350 --> 00:15:01.180
Tenshi, don't tell me you've 
forgotten about him.

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.960
No, never mind.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:09.670
It would only put you in a foul mood.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:14.170
Don't worry about me, Rikukin.

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:15.980
It has nothing to do with that demon.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:20.760
I'm simply curious about her.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:26.480
You always want to take in anyone
with potential as a disciple,

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.080
but you should pass on her.

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:31.190
She's too mysterious.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:37.280
Oh? So she's not just an employee 
of the Express Delivery Company?

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:43.320
I had my underlings look into her 
background, but they found very little.

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:50.020
The only thing they learned is that she works 
part-time for the Express Delivery Company.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:49.990
<b>We Deliver Anywhere</b>

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.330
Part-time?

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:55.540
That makes her even easier to 
poach than a regular employee.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.480
I doubt you know,

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:04.980
but part-time employees are exceptionally 
special at the Express Delivery Company.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.730
What? No way!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.320
That was fast...

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:11.270
Oh, come on!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.250
That was way too fast.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:17.620
Uh, has Soran always been this strong?

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.770
I can't believe he defeated 
Tou Bunryuu in a second.

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:28.380
No, based on this match, I don't believe 
Soran-kun is stronger than Tou Bunryuu.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.170
If anything, they're equal.

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:33.890
Tou Bunryuu underestimated Soran-kun.

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:40.840
Since Soran-kun fought at full strength from 
the start, he took control of the match.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:47.560
But if Soran-kun had fought this 
way in his previous matches,

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.690
Tou Bunryuu wouldn't have 
thought he was inferior.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.980
It may be that all the matches

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:58.160
in this tournament have been
moving at Soran-kun's pace.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.070
He's a truly interesting boy.

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:05.400
That's impossible!

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:08.540
How could that coward win?

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:12.290
You're mistaken about one thing.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:16.370
A coward isn't always incompetent.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:20.950
Wow! Are you Zen Shidou the Aokami?

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:23.270
Why did you forfeit your 
match the other day?

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:26.950
How could you let Chou Soran win like that?

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:32.040
<i>I learned that day how powerless I am.</i>

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:44.600
What's wrong, Zen-san? 
Are you quitting already?

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:47.030
But you've almost defeated me.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:50.280
If you beat me, you can get 
your revenge on Hou-nee.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:54.160
Your talismans have disabled 
the ki in my arm.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:57.010
It's the perfect opportunity to defeat me.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.970
What are you playing at?

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:03.440
You've been deliberately ignoring 
opportunities to attack me.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.680
Are you mocking me?

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:09.120
O-Of course not. 
It's just a misunderstanding.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:13.390
I just wanted to fight you 
for as long as possible.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.890
It benefits me, too.

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:18.070
Benefits you? How?

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:24.740
The truth is, unlike the others, I haven't 
had many opportunities to fight outsiders.

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:29.780
So I couldn't ask for a better 
opportunity than fighting

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:31.540
a master like you before my match.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:36.170
Besides, your desire to 
get revenge on Hou-nee

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.800
will make you fight at full 
strength to defeat me.

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:44.110
Since it's not an official match, 
it doesn't hurt me whether I win or lose.

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:45.130
It's win-win.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:49.420
So you used me for your training?

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:50.240
That's right.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:51.270
How dare you?!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:54.670
But it doesn't hurt you, either.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:55.560
What?

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:59.160
This fight helped you realize 
your own weakness, didn't it?

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:03.700
Your talismans certainly are impressive.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:06.390
They're so strong, you 
rely on them too much.

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:12.290
From the looks of it, the more ki you 
pour into them, the stronger they are.

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:17.080
But when you activate your talismans,

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:20.140
you unconsciously channel 
too much ki into them.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:23.800
That moment you spend channeling 
too much ki into your talismans

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.470
gives your opponent an 
opportunity to evade them.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:30.470
That's why you had so much trouble 
hitting me with your talismans.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:37.190
If I hadn't wanted to test their power, 
you may not have hit me a single time.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:41.040
Anyway, let's keep going.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:44.710
This time, make sure you 
don't channel too much ki.

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:46.800
Ridiculous.

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:49.570
Hey, Zen-san, where are you going?

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:54.080
I'm leaving. I have no intention 
of helping you train.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:57.000
Don't be that way. Let's keep fighting.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.790
We shouldn't waste this opportunity.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:00.370
Her...

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:02.290
The girl next to you.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:07.140
Is it true that she's far stronger than you?

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:08.880
Of course.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:15.110
Hey, why don't we stop fighting each 
other and fight Hou-nee instead?

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.740
I'm sure it'd be great training.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:18.870
Both of us against her?

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:22.490
Yeah, sure. Bring it on.

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:26.000
I've had enough. I'm leaving.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.200
<i>Chou Soran...</i>

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:33.200
<i>He's gotten even stronger since that night.</i>

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:39.530
<i>It seems I have to start my 
training over from square one.</i>

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.690
Jo San, Jo Yon.

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:47.860
Soran-kun? What about your match?

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.800
It's already over.

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:52.100
Hou-nee's should be finished soon, right?

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.480
Actually, she's struggling 
more than expected.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.110
I feel dizzy.

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.260
You're wide open!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.950
Approach carelessly, and 
he'll defeat you easily.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:17.430
If you can't use projectiles, 
you might as well admit defeat.

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:18.300
Hey!

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:19.510
Ow!

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:24.680
<i>So I just have to stay away from him.</i>

